{"id":2982,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>&nbsp;为搭建校际合作桥梁，拓宽我院学子升学路径，4月23日上午在学院713会议室，北京工业大学化学与生命科学学院生物医学工程系刘有军教授、南群教授莅临我院进行座谈交流以及研究生招生宣讲。学院副院长刘吉，生物医学工程系主任张权、副主任刘旭辉，辅导员左冠华参加座谈。</p><p>&nbsp;座谈会上，刘吉代表学院对刘有军教授、南群教授的到来表示热烈欢迎，并详细介绍了我院的办学特色、学科布局、师资力量及人才培养成果。刘有军教授介绍了北京工业大学的办学实力和学科优势。南群教授介绍了化学与生命科学学院生物医学工程系的学科建设、科研平台、师资队伍和研究生培养模式，并分享了生物医学工程专业的培养特色、研究方向与科研成果，同时肯定了我院本科生生源质量，对我院培养的学子给予了高度评价。双方就研究生招生、科研合作等事宜深入探讨，希望以此次交流为契机，搭建长期稳定的合作平台，实现互利共赢。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hU4Q3kozlbL4n7MBllDMR-PnmlYMllGsMR7aUmLDLm-iMlL0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyanShVLSy8UmCYnzrknNMkol7inzN8nmvbnlQ7LNMVoRWFM8L8LmWVMm6FLzV7LRMRgjfJQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPM4laoSbw62f8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17509&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C0EE14B62E5BFCB9A5E94F79EFD2CE82/7C422E67/11D03C\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hn7l34MmliUmV7UBlCPU87sLNnRLl-GPn778U4CYM4A2o7l0gihFp2hmCIa0L1y8M1yZU1hVUmTVL8L8LzWfUm78oz7YMNrVU8Lsnm78M8nFU4WRnm62nlnFUz-inlW2gjfJQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPM4laoSbw62f8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17509&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hMNV3fUlLbU4N4oBR7ZUm-ZL8UaU8lGsMlQVU8C8UmfkMRU0gihFp2hmCIa0okyiM1yaMSh2M4f2nzM7MzUbolCaUzGbolUPnR7iMNVfnlVFM7Q2n7CZMzrFLzlaMlUYgjfJQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPM4laoSbw62f8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17509&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/85605F70FE3D5499F0A099D1D156AAEA/4FFDF855/1505D2\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hoz93ZMRnRnzVVMB4CDLlCsMR-sozrGfUNCiU4CaL8LiolU0gihFp2hmCIa0n1hVMkyaLkhfnzlZL4ARLlL4nNL8oR-DUz6foz-ZozWVM4QFoRliM7nRnRnFLzMVL49YMYbaptveo4Oe_dAb6dAjCYhXptQ0g47aLmL0LzviLRNJqdfnx&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17509&e=.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;座谈会结束后，南群教授、刘有军教授在11211教室开展研究生招生专场宣讲。宣讲会上，两位教授从北工大研究生招生政策、专业方向、报考要求、奖助体系、就业前景等方面进行了详细解读，重点介绍了生物医学工程专业的招生计划与培养优势。宣讲会现场气氛热烈，同学们积极举手提问，围绕考研备考、科研方向等问题与两位教授深入交流。两位教授耐心细致地解答，为同学们提供了针对性的报考指导与备考建议，有效帮助同学们明晰了升学方向，激发了大家的报考热情。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hnz73PnRLiLN7YMB8liMzfkMRNsMmGGbM4viM4L8Mm-aUm70gihFp2hmCIa0nkyanSh2USyDMmG4o7UDLRCDMzQ2n7MkMmVVLmUaM7WRMRQFLm-iUNUZM4MFLz-8olUagjfJQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPM4laoSbw62f8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17509&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D0EFA66038D606656FDCB61E2404BC46/225BD873/1249D0\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hUz93DMmfRM7VkLB7-anRlZLzV2U8lGaMzNaLlnVnR-DU8l0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hknSyaU1y8nzG4nRLbU4CbMlUYMR9sUmT2LmCiUmMfMlWFM7lPMml8LlMFoR-DolUagjfJQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPM4laoSbw62f8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17509&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hMlC3PnmQ7ozviLBlCZMmC8MNlZM7LGDLRvYnzV2nzGaL4v0gihFp2hmCIa0nkyYoSyZMkyYUzTRLRAfUzl8oz7Do7LaMz9iUz7aLlliL46FLmvbnRvDUmMFLzGYMRVRgjfJQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPM4laoSbw62f8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17509&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D29842A9C08AA549168C0585A101E537/279D76B3/10241C\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hozf3kLNQ2M4CanBlM2nNLYMmA2nRAGVUl-8L7r7LR-PMm70gihFp2hmCIa0nSy8USy8MYyDolV2ozWRU87ZL4UZMmCiolL8MlVkM7r7MmWFU49iUlLYMmnFM8l8UNWRgjfJQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPM4laoSbw62f8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17509&e=.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;此次活动不仅为我院学子拓宽了升学视野，也进一步深化了两校间的沟通合作，为后续优质生源输送、学科协同发展奠定了坚实基础。</p><p><br></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://5y.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hU4Q3kozlbL4n7MBllDMR-PnmlYMllGsMR7aUmLDLm-iMlL0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyanShVLSy8UmCYnzrknNMkol7inzN8nmvbnlQ7LNMVoRWFM8L8LmWVMm6FLzV7LRMRgjfJQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPM4laoSbw62f8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17509&e=.png"}